---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";

const seo = {
  title: "Work | Lauro",
  description:
    "Senior software engineer with experience in fintech, banking, retail e-commerce and big tech, and open to freelance work :)",
};
---

<Page seo={seo}>
  <p>
    I'm a programmer at heart and work is a big part of who I am, so that's why
    it gets its own page here. I've been building things for the web since I was
    a kid, and today I'm a Senior Software Engineer at <a
      href="https://www.avenuecode.com"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener">Avenue Code</a
    >, working for big tech.
  </p>

  <h2>A little about how I work</h2>
  <p>
    I started out self-taught, building Blogger and Tumblr templates as a kid,
    and I've been learning on the job ever since. I've worked on fintech
    products, internal systems for a large bank and high-traffic retail
    e-commerce, and today I build a component library behind some of the
    world's most visited product pages. I'm mostly on the front end but
    comfortable across the stack.
  </p>
  <p>
    I care about the things users notice without knowing it: performance,
    accessibility and SEO. I like writing tests for the parts that matter,
    documenting what I build, and leaving codebases easier to work in than I
    found them. I'm happiest working close to designers and product people, and
    I've also led teams technically and mentored other developers along the
    way.
  </p>

  <h2>Freelance</h2>
  <p>
    I'm open to hearing about freelance opportunities. I'm also specialized in
    WordPress websites, from custom themes to SEO. If you have a project in
    mind, get in touch at laurofgrd(at)gmail.com.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a href="/hire">My CV</a> has the full history: roles, projects and the tools
    I used along the way.
  </p>
</Page>
